#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "You do not have permission for the device of that cluster."
msgstr "Jums nav atļaujas šī klastera ierīcei."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Name: another cluster already uses this name."
msgstr "Nosaukums: cits klasteris jau izmanto šo nosaukumu."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not saved: it was changed by someone else since the form was opened, or the write failed. Open it again and repeat the change."
msgstr "Klasteris netika saglabāts: kopš veidlapas atvēršanas to mainīja kāds cits vai ierakstīšana neizdevās. Atveriet to vēlreiz un atkārtojiet izmaiņas."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was saved."
msgstr "Klasteris tika saglabāts."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster state was not changed: the write failed. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Klastera stāvoklis netika mainīts: ierakstīšana neizdevās. Skatiet Cacti žurnālu."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster and its cached snapshot were deleted. Its device and graphs were kept. The scheduler was not contacted."
msgstr "Klasteris un tā kešotais momentuzņēmums tika dzēsti. Tā ierīce un grafiki tika saglabāti. Ar plānotāju netika veidots savienojums."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device and its graphs were created."
msgstr "Ierīce un tās grafiki tika izveidoti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device was not created: the cluster already has a device, it was changed by someone else since the page was opened, or Cacti refused it. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Ierīce netika izveidota: klasterim jau ir ierīce, kopš lapas atvēršanas to mainīja kāds cits vai Cacti to noraidīja. Skatiet Cacti žurnālu."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was mapped to the device."
msgstr "Klasteris tika piesaistīts ierīcei."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not mapped: the device does not exist, is not allowed to you, already carries another cluster, or the cluster was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Klasteris netika piesaistīts: ierīce neeksistē, jums tai nav piekļuves, tai jau ir piesaistīts cits klasteris vai klasteris tika mainīts kopš lapas atvēršanas."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Missing graphs were added."
msgstr "Trūkstošie grafiki tika pievienoti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "No graphs were added: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Grafiki netika pievienoti: klasterim nav ierīces vai tā ierīce vairs neeksistē."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not unmapped: it was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Klasteris netika atsaistīts: kopš lapas atvēršanas to mainīja kāds cits."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was unmapped. The device and its graphs were kept."
msgstr "Klasteris tika atsaistīts. Ierīce un tās grafiki tika saglabāti."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were reindexed from the snapshot."
msgstr "Partīcijas tika pārindeksētas no momentuzņēmuma."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the device is disabled or down, so Cacti skipped its data query."
msgstr "Partīcijas netika pārindeksētas: ierīce ir atspējota vai neaktīva, tāpēc Cacti izlaida tās datu vaicājumu."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: Cacti could not run the data query. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Partīcijas netika pārindeksētas: Cacti nevarēja palaist datu vaicājumu. Skatiet Cacti žurnālu."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the HPC Scheduler data query is not installed. Install the templates from the health page."
msgstr "Partīcijas netika pārindeksētas: HPC plānotāja datu vaicājums nav instalēts. Instalējiet veidnes veselības lapā."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Partīcijas netika pārindeksētas: klasterim nav ierīces vai tā ierīce vairs neeksistē."

#: hpcsched_health.php
msgid "The HPC Scheduler templates are installed."
msgstr "HPC plānotāja veidnes ir instalētas."

#: hpcsched_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates were not installed: %s"
msgstr "Veidnes netika instalētas: %s"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Uzraudzības skats"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Novērojumus nevarēja nolasīt. Lūdziet administratoram pārbaudīt spraudņa žurnālu."

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Inspect pending reason families and snapshot freshness on the overview. Escalate credentials, cluster mappings and maintenance policy to an administrator."
msgstr "Pārskatā pārbaudiet gaidīšanas iemeslu saimes un momentuzņēmuma aktualitāti. Akreditācijas datus, klasteru piesaistes un apkopes politiku nododiet administratoram."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Nosaukums: izmantojiet 1 līdz 64 burtus, ciparus, punktus, domuzīmes vai pasvītras, sākot ar burtu vai ciparu."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Aptaujātājs: izvēlieties vienu no uzskaitītajiem aptaujātājiem."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Datu vākšanas intervāls: ievadiet veselas sekundes no %d līdz %d."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Transport: choose one of the listed transports."
msgstr "Transports: izvēlieties vienu no uzskaitītajiem transporta veidiem."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurm.conf: enter an absolute path, or leave it empty to use the poller default."
msgstr "slurm.conf: ievadiet absolūto ceļu vai atstājiet tukšu, lai izmantotu aptaujātāja noklusējumu."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: this host and port are not on the slurmrestd host list in Settings."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: šis resursdators un ports nav norādīti slurmrestd resursdatoru sarakstā Iestatījumos."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: enter an https:// URL without user name, query, or fragment; plain http:// is accepted only for a loopback address."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: ievadiet https:// URL bez lietotājvārda, vaicājuma vai fragmenta; parasts http:// tiek pieņemts tikai atpakaļcilpas adresei."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd User: use at most 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, or leave it empty for a user token."
msgstr "slurmrestd lietotājs: izmantojiet ne vairāk kā 64 burtus, ciparus, punktus, domuzīmes vai pasvītras vai atstājiet tukšu lietotāja marķierim."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: enter the absolute path of the token file on the poller. The token itself is never entered here."
msgstr "Marķiera fails: ievadiet absolūto ceļu līdz marķiera failam aptaujātājā. Pats marķieris šeit nekad netiek ievadīts."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: no token file directories are set yet. Ask a Cacti administrator to set them under Settings, HPC Scheduler."
msgstr "Marķiera fails: vēl nav iestatītas marķieru failu direktorijas. Lūdziet Cacti administratoram tās iestatīt sadaļā Iestatījumi, HPC plānotājs."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token File: the file must be inside one of the token file directories set in Settings (%s)."
msgstr "Marķiera fails: failam jāatrodas vienā no Iestatījumos norādītajām marķieru failu direktorijām (%s)."

